<title>NETHERLANDS: Rotterdam port expansion plan decision tomorrow.</title>
<headline>Rotterdam port expansion plan decision tomorrow.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A  decision on whether to go ahead with port expansion and land reclamation plans in Rotterdam is expected on July 11, a spokesman from the Dutch Ministry of Transport said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are optimistic on a positive decision,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>If the project gets the go-ahead, the two possible options are a 500 hectare reclaimed area without a harbour or a 1,000 hectare site including a harbour.</p>
<p>The Dutch ministry is also due to decide on the amount of land that will be set-aside for a nature reserve.</p>
<p>-Reuters Shipping News + 44 171 542 4087. Fax 5017.</p>
